+We have revised the paper following these suggestions. (1) \textit{Differential check:} we have renamed ``Semantic Correctness'' to ``Execution Validity'' and added a sampled source-to-target result and state equivalence study (\commentref{1.1}). (2) \textit{Primary evidence:} our main claims rely on branch coverage and bug counts in RQ1 and RQ2, and the feature richness in RQ3 is presented as supplementary evidence of the testing value of transferred seeds. (3) \textit{Baseline transparency:} we have documented the configurations, seed corpora, and command lines of the RQ2 baselines, included them in our artifact, and explained the zero-bug results (\commentref{3.2}). (4) \textit{SQLRight:} we have added SQLRight to the RQ2 comparison (\commentref{3.4}).
 
